{"type":"text","timestamp":1794564789631,"sessionID":"ses_e2b9b76d2ffeVwkGdyq20xEbJh","part":{"id":"prt_1d46572ea002O9ZuCnv27Q5yDr","sessionID":"ses_e2b9b76d2ffeVwkGdyq20xEbJh","messageID":"msg_1d4655f05001DvmEK73JHz1Ux2","type":"text","text":"Verify passed. One thing to flag: the file already contained a concurrent, unrelated change from another worker.\n\n## Files written\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md` (`HD`) — one edit, in the OpenCode tuning paragraph of §6 CONFIGURATION, line 176.\n\nChanged:\n```\n`SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_COMPILED_ROUTE_BOUNDING` (compiled-route summary bounding).\n```\nto:\n```\n`SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_COMPILED_ROUTE_BOUNDING` (kept for existing configs: the transform adds no compiled-route line, so it changes only the `bounded_compiled_route_summary` status field).\n```\n\n## Verify output\n\n```\n--- rg -c 'compiled-route summary bounding' $HD ---\nexit=1\n--- rg -c 'bounded_compiled_route_summary' $HD ---\n1\nexit=0\n```\n\n`rg -c \"compiled-route summary bounding\" $HD` printed nothing (exit 1, no match) and `rg -c \"bounded_compiled_route_summary\" $HD` printed `1`. Both match the expected output.\n\n## Note on the file's other hunk\n\n`git diff` on this file shows a **second, unrelated hunk** that I did not author: the §7 `Diagnostics` row was rewritten (health record written on every prompt, `degraded: true` from the local scorer, `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` now only adding label and error text). That is another worker's in-flight edit to the same file, present in the working tree alongside mine. I left it untouched, as required. My diff contribution is only the one line above.\n\nNothing else was modified, no checkbox ticked, no git state touched.","time":{"start":1794564780778,"end":1794564789631}}}
